    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 73 plugins and 489 official stars, alongside the 0.2.1-alpha.1 release; however 14,531 of 18,166 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving the health score at 39 and growth concentrated in desktop and marketplace projects.",
